summary.label:
Distribution of players for each team in a balanced way, considering the number of players, each player's preferred position and skill level.

- Adjust the draw parameters: number of players/teams, consider positions and skill level;
- Share the result with the group on your messaging app;
- 4 sports/modalities options (soccer, futsal, volleyball and basketball) or create your own modalities with the positions you want;
- Create multiple groups of players and export group data to other devices;
